  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zanzibar Energy Sector - Znz Energy Monitor Evalua</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Zanzibar Energy Sector 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First phase energy sector support for two years, including a          short-term financial turn-around activities (TA &amp; investments) to     Zanzibar Electricity Corporation (ZECO), and TA for development of    Energy Policy to the Ministry of Water Construction Energy and Lands  (MWCEL)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tv&#xe5; &#xe5;rigt st&#xf6;d till del av ett energisektorprogram i Zanzibar. 1.     Konsultst&#xf6;d och investeringar f&#xf6;r financial turnaround av statliga    elbolaget ZECO. 2. Konsultst&#xf6;d till ministeriet MWCEL f&#xf6;r att         utveckla energipolicy.</narrative>
  </description>
